 Amulet</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If the wearer has both normal and <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Pact_Magic\" title=\"Spells\">warlock spell slots</a> of the appropriate level, this action will restore a single spell slot of both types.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040533\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3112/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40420/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12767/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1456336/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.669      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   64.669      1 -total\n 93.06%   60.181     41 Template:Trim\n 27.58%   17.836      2 Template:Item_icon\n 21.26%   13.751      1 Template:RarityItem\n 17.41%   11.260      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.50%    9.375      9 Template:Ifempty\n 11.67%    7.549      5 Template:Icon_text\n  9.95%    6.436      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.36%    6.050      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23850-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715040533 and revision id 295372. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}